{"title":"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Engineers_Induction)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Engineers Induction)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/6/e861e10e1c19918756b9c8b7717684593c63aeb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[0,1]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"34\" height=\"18\" />, define\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/8/9382b604c42d9953b7cf37fb0dd3548844fcebce.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x) = \\begin{cases}  2x, \\qquad\\qquad \\mathrm{if} \\quad 0 \\leq x \\leq \\frac{1}{2}\\\\  2-2x, \\qquad \\mathrm{if} \\quad \\frac{1}{2} &lt; x \\leq 1.  \\end{cases}\\]\" width=\"276\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/a/19a1e133f69e72ede551e9a9ac13d6fc753631b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^{[2]}(x) = f(f(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/8/b28e24ffc0a9d6d078390a1cc78472f25aad30de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^{[n + 1]}(x) = f^{[n]}(f(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"168\" height=\"20\" /> for each integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/2/72287b09043ed45b372a517d764e12d07aff8071.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\geq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />. For how many values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/6/e861e10e1c19918756b9c8b7717684593c63aeb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[0,1]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"34\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/5/1b5c58a15190bdc1a950e5afc5cd30d25cfb0bb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^{[2005]}(x) = 1/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"124\" height=\"23\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/9/5193e7e6c5c2c07d533be2c743a07d47a28def65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\mathrm {A}) \\ 0 \\qquad (\\mathrm {B}) \\ 2005 \\qquad (\\mathrm {C})\\ 4010 \\qquad (\\mathrm {D}) \\ 2005^2 \\qquad (\\mathrm {E})\\ 2^{2005}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"457\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For the two functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/e/30e75168687bbcb2a4340fadb463f42d198c736e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=2x,0\\le x\\le \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"166\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/e/3be51467c9a4cd84fe9961282f217a314fd2c31a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=2-2x,\\frac{1}{2}&lt; x\\le 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"201\" height=\"38\" />,as long as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> will be in the right domain, so we don't need to worry about the domain of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.  \n</p><p>Also, every time we change <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" />, the expression for the final answer in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> will be in a different form (although they'll all satisfy the final equation), so we get a different starting value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.  Every time we have two choices for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/c/80cb14b749dccaefe2d21370a777201a35814139.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"18\" />) and altogether we have to choose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/5/9f5b442c275b4324f100c365b774e872b6b21f1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2005$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> times. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/7/017ae3dfa330979fa196f57e6f64e825f03ace6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2005}\\Rightarrow\\boxed{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"91\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p><p>Note: the values of x that satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/7/b774d366e9a86636a0a3997073f80ee5a0149743.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^{[n]}(x) = \\frac {1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"87\" height=\"37\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/e/43eb25f80ff62093367a265c72f88b0b435622fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2^{n+1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"37\" height=\"37\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/4/704ab2ab97465a9fb82c59fe66654f4666700868.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{2^{n+1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"37\" height=\"37\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/1/8b160ac95d2d07a624c03688b670b2322e45dcd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{2^{n+1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"37\" height=\"37\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/7/087594ea26fa196b8e61bc20a36228270dc695f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"10\" /> ,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/c/9dc29018e2e82da97ddbcd7e665d7e84c3f1fdaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2^{n+1}-1}{2^{n+1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"68\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Engineers_Induction.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Engineers_Induction)\">Solution 2 (Engineers Induction)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Engineers Induction)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We are given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/8/cf8eae18d34cdc34dd8eb5c5567f33e726ef8bb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^{[2005]}(x) = \\frac {1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"106\" height=\"37\" />. Thus,  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/6/f668ee7c291e18b1df5169984a5e7eafcf5e67a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(f^{[2004]}(x))=\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"131\" height=\"37\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/5/285d6d53dec29d3b1f4452b5cf413e8d4c072e0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^{[2004]}(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" /> be equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/e/1deab21e83af79102d5d31364ab01aac2cf3204a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(y)=\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"70\" height=\"37\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/0/11073eab014b76706300e1bf7c6125137134a037.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"45\" height=\"37\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/1/e1150a17bf1b733cb666be84d920c71fc96bb3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" />. Now we know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/5/285d6d53dec29d3b1f4452b5cf413e8d4c072e0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^{[2004]}(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c339afa03e060d959e4942be7522c0c992f4c41c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/1/e1150a17bf1b733cb666be84d920c71fc96bb3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" />. Now we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/a/29a0962b1a52904e89b2f327367cc00444084fcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(f^{[2003]}(x))=\\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"131\" height=\"37\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/1/e1150a17bf1b733cb666be84d920c71fc96bb3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" />. Now we solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfbad44ab10772cc79ef6fedb6f2377099af4e68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^{[2003]}(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" /> and let  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/e/9fe4a36537e191815c0f7506fe4b2c0f84a22f80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^{[2003]}(x)=z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/1/301469a1d6b6bd4ddb15b26b27e22c03d5611b2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(z)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/b/5db9e227e8177d26de452c2a2faeb6d45cc53d7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/7/717366d5cd3f9573014d073ca33467c37c12a364.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/3/f4344e4ce1c2a266b885d9b160544e3036de15f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />,and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/9/639534d18207fde5d468bcf2bb90aa2d7ad517ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />. As we see, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/8/a7847a0f23d0dd2ddbc119cccf0265be6933d1c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^{[2005]}(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"72\" height=\"23\" /> has 1 solution, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/5/285d6d53dec29d3b1f4452b5cf413e8d4c072e0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^{[2004]}(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" /> has 2 solutions, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfbad44ab10772cc79ef6fedb6f2377099af4e68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^{[2003]}(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" /> has 4 solutions. Thus for each iteration we double the number of possible solutions. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/5/9f5b442c275b4324f100c365b774e872b6b21f1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2005$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> iterations and thus the number of solutions is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/a/ceaede13e4a7750e7d95af5d1a7c1f71ec944efb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2005}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/e/27e53b122c7353446fc55a2e7736f57d27db682d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow\\boxed{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"49\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A\">2005 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Pr